experiment.prespecified:
Fixed 2026-11-20, before any result of this definition was read (owner, borg-reborn-rs PR #728). classes-18 is
the gate (RULES 16); small and medium (starts 1-360) follow right after it.
Gate:
- no config_error; one binary; each arm's values in borg.txt and in params-core.json of the death replays
  (the class value the character's class resolves to);
- every cell ends in death, turn_cap or borg_stopped; frozen-turn bursts classified and key outliers listed;
- death bundles reproduced.
Report per arm and per class:
- deaths and causes, final and maximum level, deepest level; paired rescued and newly killed against d0 (exact
  McNemar), and games identical to d0;
- **floating eye deaths** (and other NEVER_MOVE killers), by character level;
- detection casts per game ("# Casting" Detect Evil, Detect Monsters, Read Minds, Seek Battle) below CL10;
- mana rests per game ("# Resting to recover HP/SP" with SP below max) and the share of game turns resting, for
  Priests and Paladins (#685's measure);
- mean max CL and DL against d0, with non-inferiority at the margins of borg-zoo#347 (CL -0.25, DL -0.25).
Bin each arm (RULES 18).
